The card's styles for A-NAS. The SVG alpha fix filter over every video frame goes: on the NAS,
which may draw without a GPU, it is likely to cost CPU on every frame, and the companion has
played without it so far. The cursor images and the bubble's bundled font go, since A-NAS does
not serve them (plain grab cursors and the font stack's fallbacks instead), and so do the
right-click menu's styles, as there is no menu. The pet's z-index reads --dsh-pet-z,
defaulting to dsh-pet's 40, so the page can place the pet among its own layers.

